  "headline": "President Prabowo Subianto Links New Kapolri to Reduced Concerns",
  "seoTitle": "Prabowo Links Mabes Polri Leadership to MBG Success",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto attributes a decrease in social media influencers and food poisoning incidents to the leadership of the new Kapolri.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto credited the new Kapolri, Jenderal Suyudi Ario Seto, for positive changes in public discourse.",
    "Reports indicate that the number of social media influencers has declined since the change in police leadership.",
    "The administration noted a significant reduction in food poisoning cases linked to the Makan Bergizi Gratis program under new police oversight."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "President Prabowo Subianto recently highlighted the impact of current police leadership on national stability and government program efficacy. Following the appointment of Jenderal Suyudi Ario Seto as the new Kapolri, the President observed a decrease in social media influencer activities and fewer health incidents related to the Makan Bergizi Gratis (MBG) initiative. These remarks followed earlier discussions involving the President and former national police chiefs, where topics such as national security and integrity were addressed. The administration has emphasized the importance of maintaining professional conduct within the police force, drawing inspiration from past leaders of the institution. As the government continues to prioritize these institutional shifts, authorities are also investigating unrelated allegations involving former officials, signaling a broader focus on accountability and the effectiveness of law enforcement agencies under the current leadership.",
